先拍到车灯映照着隧道潮湿的墙面，伴随着外面传来的阵阵轰鸣。汽车驶出隧道的瞬间，画面骤然一变——狂风夹着倾盆暴雨横扫整个视野，雨水像银针一样密集打在挡风玻璃上，刮得雨刷匆忙来回。天空被厚重的乌云吞噬，灰黑翻涌，如同压顶的海浪。\n\n驾驶座旁 @sama 紧张又有点兴奋，用半开玩笑的口吻喊道：\n“天啊！湛江今天是台风17级啊！太疯狂了！这是科哥的家乡，居然用这种方式迎接我们！”\n\n9:16画面。镜头随着路面景色递进，树木在狂风中剧烈摇摆，路边的广告牌被吹得吱吱作响，雨雾笼罩高速公路，能见度急剧下降。偶尔能看见远处海面掀起巨大的白浪，仿佛要越过堤岸扑来。\n\n同一时间，@sama激动带点惊叹地大喊：\n“我的天！这台风太恐怖了吧！像电影里的灾难现场！”\n\n后面的镜头持续拍摄高速路上的暴雨与狂风景象，风雨中车速放缓，镜头逐渐拉近挡风玻璃，雨水顺着镜面不停滑落，外面的世界只剩下翻腾的水与无尽的风声。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [17], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [370.9224548339844, 349.2914733886719], "pos": [2251.72119140625, 741.2971801757812], "widgets_values": ["seedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors", 1916382297, "randomize", 4320, 9], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 19, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "block_swap_config", "label": "block_swap_config", "type": "block_swap_config", "localized_name": "block_swap_config"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "extra_args", "label": "extra_args", "type": "extra_args", "localized_name": "extra_args"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "new_resolution"}, "name": "new_resolution", "label": "new_resolution", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "new_resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "SeedVR2", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SeedVR2"}, "order": 11}], "extra": {"links_added_by